 "press_quotes": [
  {
   "quote": "The new yacht can accommodate a larger crew, with a system of sliding doors that open wide to combine the interior saloon table and the exterior cockpit table, forming one large table to seat 12 people.",
   "source": "BOAT NEWS"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Lagoon has re-envisioned life on board, introducing a versatile boat with modular boundaries.  This advance enables you to transform the living space, connecting the interior and exterior according to preference, between the saloon and the cockpit.",
   "source": "LE FIGARO NAUTISME"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The volume in the forward bows has been optimized to enlarge the berths; what’s more, the Owner’s Version features a forward berth.",
   "source": "MULTICOQUES MAG"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Lagoon has announced the imminent arrival of the Lagoon 43, which will replace one of the brand’s most iconic models, the 42 — soon to be honored with a limited edition called the Millennium.",
   "source": "YACHT CLASS MONACO"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The new Lagoon 43 has a very different hull shape to its predecessor, with much broader forward sections above the waterline. Key motivations for this were to create a charter version with four equal double cabins, all with large peninsula beds, and to move the berth in the owner’s suite to the front of the boat in three-cabin layouts, without compromising the size of the bed.",
   "source": "YACHTING WORLD"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Aesthetically, the lines are clean and uncluttered. The ­waterline is maxed out, the freeboard is ample, and there’s a noticeable chine in the hulls—a nod toward expanded ­interior volume in the staterooms. The raised steering ­station, beneath a hard Bimini top, is to port.",
   "source": "CRUISING WORLD"
  },
  {
   "quote": "This new Lagoon 43 brings a fresh approach to the cruising catamaran, a category that is otherwise well established. Its voluminous hulls provide unprecedented space in the forward cabins, without performance appearing to suffer as a result.",
   "source": "VOILE & MOTEUR"
  },
  {
   "quote": "This fully newly designed model brimming with innovation in all important segments is even more suitable for charter and undoubtedly a pure Lagoon family member, which both guarantees its global success",
   "source": "YACHT CROATIA"
  }
 ]
}
